<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Oncology started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Oncology started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc said on Monday it was lowering its rating on the shares of American Oncology Resources to a buy-market outperformer from a buy focus, because of valuation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Kurt Fish said in a research note he raised his 12-month price target to $17 per share from $15 per share.</p>
<p>-- While Fish said he believed the company was fairly valued now, long-term growth prospects were promising.</p>
<p>-- Shares of American Oncology were off 1/32 at 14-25/32.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
